WEBVTT

33:33.378 --> 33:35.379
"Rendezvous with Star Command."

33:36.756 --> 33:39.007
-Hey, gas dude!
-You talkin' to me?

33:39.092 --> 33:41.551
-Yeah, man. Can you help me?
-Pizza Planet? Andy!

33:41.636 --> 33:43.595
Do you know
where Cutting Boulevard is?

33:43.680 --> 33:45.055
Oh, no!

33:45.139 --> 33:48.016
I can't show my face
in that room without Buzz.

33:48.101 --> 33:51.019
-Buzz! Buzz, come back!
-Go away!

33:51.479 --> 33:54.481
No! Buzz, you gotta
come back! I...

33:56.359 --> 33:58.694
I found a spaceship!
